---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  wide
  pageClass="quiet-third-space-page"
  title="Third Space Labs"
  description="Third Space Labs is an independent research venture in formation, co-founded by economists Ian Helfrich and Elizaveta Gonchar."
>
  <div class="third-space-shell">
    <header class="third-space-header">
      <div>
        <p class="third-space-label">Independent research venture · in formation</p>
        <h1>Third Space Labs</h1>
      </div>
      <p class="third-space-lead">Third Space Labs is an independent research venture in formation, co-founded by economists Ian Helfrich and Elizaveta Gonchar. Its public record is intentionally small and tied to work that can be attributed clearly.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="status-section" aria-labelledby="third-space-status">
      <div>
        <p class="section-label">Current status</p>
        <h2 id="third-space-status">In formation</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="status-copy">
        <p>The venture provides a home for joint research, methods development, and future educational work. The form of any program, fellowship, or external partnership remains unsettled.</p>
        <aside><strong>Public boundary</strong><span>No application cycle, fellowship, or institutional affiliation is announced on this page.</span></aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="research-section" aria-labelledby="third-space-research">
      <p class="section-label">Current shared record</p>
      <h2 id="third-space-research">Joint research with public status</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>
          <p>Preprint · SSRN 5202676 · 2025</p>
          <article><h3><a href="/research/gonchar-helfrich-2025-spotlight">Trade in the Spotlight</a></h3><span>With Elizaveta Gonchar. Population and night-light information are used to construct economically weighted bilateral distance for gravity models.</span></article>
          <aside><strong>Limit</strong><span>The preprint does not establish the planned transport-network extension or a completed global panel.</span></aside>
        </li>
        <li>
          <p>Active development · no results yet</p>
          <article><h3><a href="/research/gonchar-helfrich-2026-effective-distance-panel">Effective distance</a></h3><span>A planned time-varying bilateral trade-cost panel using satellite, population, and transport-network information.</span></article>
          <aside><strong>Limit</strong><span>No validated panel, coverage claim, or completed result exists yet.</span></aside>
        </li>
        <li>
          <p>Active development · no results yet</p>
          <article><h3><a href="/research/gonchar-helfrich-2026-ukraine">Ukraine wartime economic measurement</a></h3><span>A proposed spatial measurement program combining several public and administrative source families.</span></article>
          <aside><strong>Limit</strong><span>No completed index, empirical result, or ratified contribution statement exists yet.</span></aside>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="principles-section" aria-labelledby="third-space-principles">
      <p class="section-label">Working principles</p>
      <h2 id="third-space-principles">Clear attribution and visible limits</h2>
      <div>
        <article><strong>Questions precede formats</strong><p>The research question determines the data, method, and public artifact.</p></article>
        <article><strong>Contribution is named</strong><p>Authors, coauthors, and contributors are credited using the role supported by each record.</p></article>
        <article><strong>Status remains literal</strong><p>A design with no result is labeled that way. Drafts and preprints are never presented as publications.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="founders-section" aria-labelledby="third-space-founders">
      <p class="section-label">Co-founders</p>
      <h2 id="third-space-founders">Ian Helfrich and Elizaveta Gonchar</h2>
      <div>
        <article><span>IAN HELFRICH</span><h3>Applied economist, quantitative research designer, and educator</h3><p>Ian's public work spans place-based policy, trade, labor and AI, spatial measurement, theory, and quantitative education.</p><a href="/about">About Ian</a></article>
        <article><span>ELIZAVETA GONCHAR</span><h3>Economist, research collaborator, and coauthor</h3><p>Elizaveta Gonchar's joint public record on this site covers trade, effective distance, and development-stage wartime economic measurement.</p><a href="/people/elizaveta-gonchar">Public collaborator record</a></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="third-space-contact">
      <div><p class="section-label">Contact</p><h2>Research conversations</h2></div>
      <div><p>For a research or institutional inquiry connected to Third Space Labs, send a short note describing the question, stage, and proposed relationship.</p><a href="mailto:ianthelfrich@gmail.com?subject=Third%20Space%20Labs">Email Ian Helfrich</a></div>
    </footer>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .third-space-shell { width: min(100%, 74rem); margin-inline: auto; }
  .third-space-header { display: grid; padding-block: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 6rem); grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(18rem, .75fr); gap: 2rem 5rem; align-items: end; border-block: 1px solid var(--ef-ink); }
  .third-space-label, .section-label, .research-section > ol > li > p, .research-section aside strong, .founders-section article > span { color: var(--muted); font: 620 .68rem/1.5 var(--font-data); letter-spacing: .07em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  h1 { max-width: 10ch; margin: .6rem 0 0; font-size: clamp(3.6rem, 8vw, 7rem); }
  .third-space-lead { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2vw, 1.45rem); }
  .status-section, .third-space-contact { display: grid; padding-block: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem); grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .75fr) minmax(18rem, 1.25fr); gap: 2rem 5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ef-ink); }
  .status-section h2, .third-space-contact h2 { margin: .45rem 0 0; font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem); }
  .status-copy > p, .third-space-contact > div:last-child > p { max-width: 62ch; font-size: 1.1rem; }
  .status-copy aside { display: grid; max-width: 38rem; margin-top: 2rem; padding-left: 1rem; gap: .35rem; color: var(--ef-oxide); border-left: 3px solid currentColor; }
  .status-copy aside strong { font: 620 .68rem/1.5 var(--font-data); letter-spacing: .07em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .research-section, .principles-section, .founders-section { padding-block: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ef-ink); }
  .research-section > h2, .principles-section > h2, .founders-section > h2 { max-width: 17ch; margin: .45rem 0 2.5rem; font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem); }
  .research-section ol { margin: 0; padding: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--ef-ink); list-style: none; }
  .research-section li { display: grid; margin: 0; padding-block: 1.5rem; grid-template-columns: 12rem minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(14rem, 20rem); gap: 1.5rem 3rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ef-ink); }
  .research-section h3 { margin: 0 0 .6rem; font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 3vw, 2.4rem); }
  .research-section h3 a { color: var(--ef-ink); }
  .research-section aside { padding-left: 1rem; color: var(--ef-oxide); border-left: 3px solid currentColor; }
  .research-section aside span { display: block; margin-top: .3rem; font-size: .92rem; }
  .principles-section > div, .founders-section > div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); border: 1px solid var(--ef-ink); }
  .principles-section article, .founders-section article { padding: 1.25rem; border-left: 1px solid var(--ef-ink); }
  .principles-section article:first-child, .founders-section article:first-child { border-left: 0; }
  .principles-section article strong { font: 620 1.1rem/1.35 var(--font-display); }
  .principles-section article p, .founders-section article p { margin: .6rem 0 0; color: var(--muted); }
  .founders-section > div { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  .founders-section h3 { margin: .6rem 0 1rem; font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 3vw, 2.35rem); }
  .founders-section a, .third-space-contact a { display: inline-flex; min-height: 44px; margin-top: 1rem; align-items: center; font: 650 .7rem/1.4 var(--font-data); text-transform: uppercase; }
  @media (max-width: 48rem) { .third-space-header, .status-section, .third-space-contact, .research-section li, .principles-section > div, .founders-section > div { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .principles-section article, .founders-section article { border-top: 1px solid var(--ef-ink); border-left: 0; } .principles-section article:first-child, .founders-section article:first-child { border-top: 0; } }
</style>
